@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+Times and durations can be typed in short form. They are completed as soon as the field is
+left, so Kimai's own calculations keep working. This works in the record dialog and on
+**Weekly hours**.
+
+| You type | Time field | Duration field |
+| -------- | ---------- | -------------- |
+| `9`      | 9:00       | 0:09           |
+| `945`    | 9:45       | 9:45           |
+| `1330`   | 13:30      | 13:30          |
+| `10`     |            | 0:10           |
+| `90`     |            | 1:30           |
+
+Times also accept `9.45`, `9h45` and `945p`, and follow the user's 12- or 24-hour format.
+Every other format Kimai supports is passed on unchanged.
+
+### Permissions
+
+The plugin adds no permissions and needs no configuration.
+
+### Support
+
+Report problems and ideas in the plugin's
+[issues](https://github.com/FaliseDotCom/kimai-short-time-entries-bundle/issues). The full documentation is in its [README](https://github.com/FaliseDotCom/kimai-short-time-entries-bundle#readme).
+
+### Works well with
+
+This plugin is one of five made to work together; each also works on its own:
